      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. \n' +
        '2. ## Rules\n' +
        '3. \n' +
        '4. - **Only read `status.json` for routing** from subagent artifact directories — never `output.md`. `ralph-planner/tasks.json` is the explicit control-file exception for planner-loop bookkeeping.\n' +
        '5. - **Never push to the default branch** directly\n' +
        '6. - **If blocked**, set STATUS to `blocked` and explain why\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. Always wait for the individual subagents to give you their return values before making any decisions. This is critical to enforcing the stability and predictability of the entire workflow.\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. ## Important constraints \n' +
        '11. \n' +
        '12. Never emit an empty response or stop without completing the full workflow.'
    },
