      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: devralph-frontend\n' +
        '3. description: "Frontend architecture reference covering JavaScript (ES modules + Webpack, 4 bundles: theme, Algolia search, DocsBot, learn portal), jQuery patterns, Tailwind v4 CSS-first config, Less legacy styling, and third-party libraries. Use this skill whenever you write or modify JavaScript under src/_assets/js/, add UI components, fix Algolia search behavior, work with CSS (Less or Tailwind), add @source directives for Tailwind class scanning, or need to understand bundle structure — the site runs a dual CSS system where knowing which to use and how they interact prevents subtle styling conflicts."\n' +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. {% raw %}\n' +
        '6. \n' +
        '7. # Frontend Architecture\n' +
        '8. \n' +
        '9. All frontend code lives in `src/_assets/`.\n' +
        '10. \n' +
        '11. ## JavaScript Architecture\n' +
        '12. \n' +
        '13. ### Module System\n' +
        '14. \n' +
        '15. ES modules (`import`/`export`) transpiled by Babel, bundled by Webpack into 4 bundles exposed as global `var` libraries.\n' +
        '16. \n' +
        '17. ### Bundles\n' +
        '18. \n' +
        '19. | Bundle | Entry | Global | Purpose |\n' +
        '20. |--------|-------|--------|---------|\n' +
        '21. | `kenticoTheme.min.js` | `js/modules/index.js` | `kenticoTheme` | Core site UI |\n' +
        '22. | `kenticoAlgolia.min.js` | `js/algolia/index.js` | `kenticoAlgolia` | Full-text search |\n' +
        '23. | `kenticoDocsbot.min.js` | `js/docsbot/index.js` | `kenticoDocsbot` | AI chat widget |\n' +
        '24. | `learnPortal.min.js` | `js/learnPortal/index.js` | `learnPortal` | Tutorial/learning portal |\n' +
        '25. \n' +
        '26. ### Core Theme Modules (`js/modules/`)\n' +
        '27. \n' +
        '28. | Module | Purpose |\n' +
        '29. |--------|---------|\n' +
        '30. | `init.js` | Bootstrap: jQuery `$(document).ready()`, initializes all components |\n' +
        '31. | `header.js` | Mobile hamburger menu, scroll-to-anchor offsetting for fixed header |\n' +
        '32. | `pageTree.js` | Sidebar navigation tree, auto-scroll to current page |\n' +
        '33. | `prism.js` | PrismJS setup with 15+ language grammars + line-highlight/line-numbers |\n' +
        '34. | `versionSwitcher.js` | Product version dropdown with version-specific URL rewriting |\n' +
        '35. | `keyboardShortcuts.js` | `Alt+T` (page tree), `Alt+R` (reading mode) |\n' +
        '36. | `feedbackCollector.js` | DocsBot-powered feedback form |\n' +
        '37. | `readingModeSwitcher.js` | Layout mode toggle via `localStorage` |\n' +
        '38. | `sidebarHider.js` | Sidebar collapse toggle via `localStorage` |\n' +
        '39. | `devFrameworkSwitcher-12.js` | KX12 version content filtering |\n' +
        '40. | `devFrameworkSwitcher-13.js` | KX13 version content filtering |\n' +
        '41. \n' +
        '42. ### Algolia Search (`js/algolia/`)\n' +
        '43. \n' +
        '44. 10 component directories using a custom widget pattern:\n' +
        '45. \n' +
        '46. - `SearchClient` — Algolia API connection\n' +
        '47. - `SearchBox` — Search input with autocomplete\n' +
        '48. - `SearchResults` — Hit rendering\n' +
        '49. - `Filters` — Facet filters (persona, classification)\n' +
        '50. - `Configuration` — instantsearch.js config\n' +
        '51. - `SearchIndex` — Index selection\n' +
        '52. - `MissingPagesSearch` — Fallback search\n' +
        '53. - `LearnPortalHits` — Learn portal-specific results\n' +
        '54. - `Tag` / `Widget` — Base component abstractions\n' +
        '55. \n' +
        '56. Built on `instantsearch.js` with URL routing that syncs query/page state. Dev model stored in `localStorage` and applied as Algolia refinement filter.\n' +
        '57. \n' +
        '58. ### Learn Portal JS (`js/learnPortal/`)\n' +
        '59. \n' +
        '60. - Progress tracking with localStorage\n' +
        '61. - Entity state management (modules, paths)\n' +
        '62. - Module metadata display\n' +
        '63. \n' +
        '64. ### Third-Party Libraries\n' +
        '65. \n' +
        '66. | Library | Integration | Location |\n' +
        '67. |---------|-------------|----------|\n' +
        '68. | **jQuery** | Global `$()` | Vendored `jquery.min.js`, `jquery.scrollTo.min.js` |\n' +
        '69. | **PrismJS** | npm | Syntax highlighting |\n' +
        '70. | **instantsearch.js** | npm via `algoliasearch` | Search UI framework |'
    },
