      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: devralph-gulp-pipeline\n' +
        '3. description: "Build pipeline reference for the Gulp 5 orchestration layer in gulp-utils/. Covers task architecture, the asset pipeline (Less + Tailwind CSS + Webpack JS bundling), Jekyll CLI integration, BrowserSync dev server, config overlay system (~15 YAML files), incremental build caching, and all available gulp tasks. Use this skill whenever you modify or create gulp tasks, change asset processing or bundling, debug build failures related to task ordering or config merging, work with BrowserSync live reload, or need to understand how build stages connect — the pipeline has non-obvious dependencies between tasks that this skill maps."\n' +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. {% raw %}\n' +
        '6. \n' +
        '7. # Gulp Build Pipeline\n' +
        '8. \n' +
        '9. The docs site uses **Gulp 5** to orchestrate all build steps. Infrastructure lives in `gulp-utils/`.\n' +
        '10. \n' +
        '11. ## Directory Structure\n' +
        '12. \n' +
        '13. ```\n' +
        '14. gulpfile.js                          ← Re-exports all tasks from gulp-utils/tasks/\n' +
        '15. gulp-utils/\n' +
        '16.   tasks/                             ← Exported task compositions\n' +
        '17.     build.js                         ← CI/CD build variants\n' +
        '18.     serve.js                         ← Local dev server\n' +
        '19.     algolia.js                       ← Algolia index update tasks\n' +
        '20.     validation.js                    ← External URL + Markdown validation\n' +
        '21.     tests.js                         ← RSpec test runner\n' +
        '22.     watch.js                         ← Dependency generation alias\n' +
        '23.     release.js                       ← Changelog release generation\n' +
        '24.     api-examples.js                  ← .NET API example generation\n' +
        '25.   gulp-assets.js                     ← CSS/JS/image/font pipeline\n' +
        '26.   gulp-jekyll.js                     ← Jekyll build orchestration\n' +
        '27.   gulp-jekyll-configs.js             ← Config merging + theme file generation\n' +
        '28.   gulp-browsersync.js                ← BrowserSync dev server\n' +
        '29.   gulp-algolia.js                    ← Algolia indexing wrapper\n' +
        '30.   gulp-tests.js                     ← RSpec execution\n' +
        '31.   gulp-validation.js                ← Validation runners\n' +
        '32.   builders/\n' +
        '33.     jsConfigBuilder.js               ← Generates theme.config.generated.js from YAML\n' +
        '34.     nginxConfigBuilder.js             ← Generates nginx.conf from YAML\n' +
        '35.   caching/\n' +
        '36.     treeComparer.js                  ← Page tree cache (triggers full rebuild on structure changes)\n' +
        '37.     moduleComparer.js                ← Learn Portal module cache\n' +
        '38.     changelogComparer.js             ← Changelog source cache\n' +
        '39.   paths.js                           ← Central path constants (100+ paths)\n' +
        '40.   spawner.js                         ← Cross-platform child_process wrapper\n' +
        '41.   utils.js                           ← Shared utilities\n' +
        '42. ```\n' +
        '43. \n' +
        '44. ## Key Gulp Tasks\n' +
        '45. \n' +
        '46. | Task | Command | Purpose |\n' +
        '47. |------|---------|---------|\n' +
        '48. | `run_serve` | `npm run serve` | Local dev: deps → assets → incremental Jekyll → BrowserSync |\n' +
        '49. | `run_build` | `npm run build` | Local build (no server) |\n' +
        '50. | `build_jekyll_full` | CI only | Production: deps → hashed assets → Jekyll |\n' +
        '51. | `build_jekyll_prv` | CI only | PR validation: infra → deps → validation → build |\n' +
        '52. | `rspec_tests` | `npx gulp rspec_tests` | Run all Ruby gem RSpec tests |\n' +
        '53. | `update_algolia_*` | CI only | Push search indexes to Algolia |\n' +
        '54. | `validate_external_urls` | CI only | Validate all external URLs |\n' +
        '55. | `validate_markdown` | CI only | Validate markdown content |\n' +
        '56. \n' +
        '57. ## Asset Pipeline\n' +
        '58. \n' +
        '59. ### CSS (Dual System)\n' +
        '60. \n' +
        '61. ```\n' +
        '62. Less (*.less) → gulp-less → [hash] → src/build/css/theme.main.css\n' +
        '63. Tailwind (tailwind/) → @tailwindcss/postcss → [hash] → src/build/css/tailwind.css\n' +
        '64. ```\n' +
        '65. \n' +
        '66. Both outputs load in parallel on the page. New components use Tailwind; legacy layout is in Less.\n' +
        '67. \n' +
        '68. ### JavaScript (Webpack)\n' +
        '69. \n' +
        '70. 4 bundles via Webpack + Babel + Terser:'
    },
