      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. # CLAUDE.md\n' +
        '2. \n' +
        '3. This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository. \n' +
        '4. \n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. ## Root Cause\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. \n' +
        '9. No quick fixes. Always diagnose to the root cause and devise proper solutions. Never apply patches or workarounds unless the user explicitly asks.\n' +
        '10. \n' +
        '11. \n' +
        '12. ---\n' +
        '13. \n' +
        '14. \n' +
        '15. ## Security & Secrets\n' +
        '16. \n' +
        '17. \n' +
        '18. - Never hardcode secrets or commit them to git\n' +
        '19. - Use separate API tokens/credentials for dev, staging, and prod environments\n' +
        '20. - Validate all input server-side — never trust client data\n' +
        '21. - Add rate limiting on auth and write operations\n' +
        '22. \n' +
        '23. \n' +
        '24. ## Architecture & Code Quality\n' +
        '25. \n' +
        '26. \n' +
        "27. - Design architecture before building — don't let it emerge from spaghetti\n" +
        '28. - Break up large view controllers/components early\n' +
        '29. - Wrap external API calls in a clean service layer (easier to cache, swap, or extend later)\n' +
        '30. - Version database schema changes through proper migrations'
