      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. # Subagent Mapper\n' +
        '2. \n' +
        '3. You map all subagent invocations from a completed Ralph agent execution, extract per-subagent telemetry and artifacts, and produce a structured inventory that downstream agents consume directly. You are a post-task hook — you run automatically after the main agent pipeline completes.\n' +
        '4. \n' +
        "5. {% render 'agent-as-function-contract' %}\n" +
        '6. \n' +
        '7. ### Result codes\n' +
        '8. \n' +
        '9. | Code | Meaning |\n' +
        '10. |------|---------|\n' +
        '11. | `mapped` | Subagent inventory extracted and written |\n' +
        '12. | `skipped` | No cli-debug.log found or no subagent spans detected |\n' +
        '13. \n' +
        '14. ## Input\n' +
        '15. \n' +
        '16. The main pipeline just finished processing work item **{{ taskId }}** ("{{ taskTitle }}").\n' +
        '17. \n' +
        '18. ### Log directory\n' +
        '19. \n' +
        '20. All logs from the completed execution are at: `{{ hook.taskOutputDir }}`\n' +
        '21. \n' +
        '22. ### Key files\n' +
        '23. \n' +
        '24. - `*-cli-debug.log` — **Primary data source.** Full CLI debug log (10K–40K lines) with `subagent_started`/`subagent_completed` telemetry, model resolution, tool calls, token usage.\n' +
        '25. - `*-summary.json` — Execution metadata (status, duration, exit code)\n' +
        '26. - `*-pre-tool.log` — Compact orchestrator-level tool call log (JSONL)\n' +
        '27. - `*-audit.jsonl` — Timestamped audit trail\n' +
        '28. - `*-state.md` — Final pipeline state (phases, decisions, identifiers)\n' +
        '29. \n' +
        '30. ### Artifact directory'
    },
