      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: ralph-training-modules\n' +
        '3. description: "YAML schema and templates for creating structured training modules and learning paths. Use this skill whenever creating or editing training modules, defining module sequences, writing module introduction or conclusion pages, organizing learning paths, or when the task involves the _modules or _paths directories."\n' +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. # Training Modules Skill\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. Instructions for creating structured training modules and learning paths for Xperience by Kentico documentation.\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. ## File Structure\n' +
        '11. \n' +
        '12. ### Modules\n' +
        '13. - **Location**: `src/_documentation/_modules/_modules/{persona}/{module-name}/`\n' +
        '14. - **Persona folders**: `developer`, `business`, `admin`, `architect`\n' +
        '15. - **Required files**:\n' +
        '16.   - `{module-name}.yml` - Module configuration (REQUIRED)\n' +
        '17.   - Introduction page (optional): `{module-name}.md` or `landing.md`\n' +
        '18.   - Conclusion page (optional): `{module-name}-learn-more.md` or `conclusion.md`\n' +
        '19. \n' +
        '20. ### Learning Paths\n' +
        '21. - **Location**: `src/_documentation/_paths/_paths/{path-name}/`\n' +
        '22. - **Required files**:\n' +
        '23.   - `{path-name}.yml` - Path configuration\n' +
        '24.   - `{path-name}.md` or `{path-name}-landing.md` - Landing page\n' +
        '25. \n' +
        '26. ## Module YAML Structure\n' +
        '27. \n' +
        '28. ```yaml\n' +
        '29. module_title: [Display title - concise, descriptive]\n' +
        '30. module_description: [One sentence describing what learners will accomplish]\n' +
        '31. persona: [developer|business|architect]\n' +
        '32. \n' +
        '33. sequence:\n' +
        '34.   - page:\n' +
        "35.       filename: 'landing.md'\n" +
        '36.   - page:\n' +
        '37.       identifier: [page_identifier_from_docs]\n' +
        '38.       collection: [guides|documentation|api]\n' +
        '39.       exclude: [Section heading to hide]\n' +
        '40.       frontmatter:\n' +
        '41.         title: [Custom title for this context]\n' +
        '42.   - page:\n' +
        '43.       identifier: [page_identifier]\n' +
        '44.       collection: guides\n' +
        '45.       subpages:\n' +
        '46.         - start: start\n' +
        '47.           end: [Next heading text]\n' +
        '48.           slug: [url-friendly-name]\n' +
        '49.           exclude: [Sections to hide]\n' +
        '50.           frontmatter:\n' +
        '51.             title: [Step title]\n' +
        '52.   - page:\n' +
        "53.       filename: 'conclusion.md'\n" +
        '54. ```\n' +
        '55. \n' +
        '56. ### Key YAML Properties\n' +
        '57. \n' +
        `58. **exclude**: Remove sections from linked pages (e.g., "What's next?", "Before you start")\n` +
        '59. - Can be a string or list of strings\n' +
        '60. - Must match heading text **EXACTLY** including punctuation\n' +
        '61. - Always verify the section exists in the target guide before adding to exclude list\n' +
        '62. - Use `grep_search` or `read_file` to confirm exact heading text\n' +
        '63. \n' +
        '64. **Common sections to exclude:**\n' +
        `65. - "What's next?" — navigation to other guides (exclude by default in modules)\n` +
        '66. - "Before you start" — prerequisites already covered in module intro\n' +
        '67. - "Set up the project" — setup steps when learner already has environment\n' +
        '68. \n' +
        '69. **subpages**: Break a long guide into discrete learning steps\n' +
        '70. - `start`: Beginning heading (use "start" for page beginning)'
    },
