      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: malph-workflow-verify\n' +
        '3. description: "Malph review workflow Phase 3. Read this skill after scouting the PR. Dispatch the technical reviewer and record its status.json result."\n' +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. # Phase 3: Verify Technical Claims\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. ## Before you begin\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. 1. **Read `state.md`** at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/state.md`\n' +
        "11. 2. This skill is for **Phase 3: Verify Technical Claims**. If you've already completed this phase, skip to the next.\n" +
        '12. \n' +
        '13. ## Instructions\n' +
        '14. \n' +
        '15. Dispatch the technical reviewer:\n' +
        '16. \n' +
        '17. 1. **Dispatch `ralph-reviewer-technical`** with the task-id and a one-line directive (e.g. "Review technical accuracy for {{ taskId }}"). The reviewer reads the scout\'s artifact and changed files directly from the filesystem.\n' +
        '18. 2. After the reviewer returns, read its `status.json` at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/ralph-reviewer-technical/status.json`.\n' +
        '19. 3. Record the `result` and `summary` in `state.md`.\n' +
        '20. \n' +
        '21. Do **not** read `review-findings.json` or `output.md`. The verdict agent reads all reviewer findings.\n' +
        '22. \n' +
        '23. ## Before moving to Phase 4\n' +
        '24. \n' +
        '25. Update `state.md`:\n' +
        '26. - Set "Current Phase" to `Phase 4: Review`\n' +
        '27. - Set "Skills for this phase" to:\n' +
        '28.   - malph-workflow-review\n' +
        '29. - Add Phase 3 to "Completed Phases"\n' +
        '30. - Record the technical reviewer\'s `result` and `summary` from `status.json` under "Technical Review Status"'
    },
