      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: malph-vscode-workflow-review-panel\n' +
        '3. description: "VS Code extension review orchestrator Phase 3. Dispatch three independent reviewers sequentially — Opus, GPT, Gemini — each running the full review checklist independently."\n' +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. # Phase 3: Review Panel\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. ## Before you begin\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. 1. **Read `state.md`** at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/state.md`\n' +
        '11. 2. **Verify the current phase** — this skill is for Phase 3.\n' +
        '12. 3. **Review completed phases** — confirm Phase 2 (Scout) is done.\n' +
        '13. \n' +
        '14. ## Instructions\n' +
        '15. \n' +
        '16. Dispatch three independent reviewers **in sequence**. Each reviewer:\n' +
        "17. - Reads the scout's artifacts (diff mapping, build results, focus areas)\n" +
        '18. - Runs the full 7-category review checklist independently\n' +
        '19. - Posts file-level PR threads on ADO with their model attribution prefix\n' +
        '20. - Writes `jira-findings.json` and `status.json` to their artifact directory\n' +
        '21. \n' +
        '22. ### Step 1: Dispatch malph-reviewer-opus\n' +
        '23. \n' +
        '24. Delegate to `malph-reviewer-opus`. Wait for completion.\n' +
        '25. \n' +
        '26. Read `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/malph-reviewer-opus/status.json`.\n' +
        '27. \n' +
        '28. | `result` | Action |\n' +
        '29. |---|---|\n' +
        '30. | `approved` | Record verdict, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '31. | `needs-revision` | Record verdict, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '32. | `failed` / `blocked` | Note error, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '33. \n' +
        '34. Update `state.md` — record the Opus verdict in the Reviewer Verdicts table.\n' +
        '35. \n' +
        '36. ### Step 2: Dispatch malph-reviewer-gpt\n' +
        '37. \n' +
        '38. Delegate to `malph-reviewer-gpt`. Wait for completion.\n' +
        '39. \n' +
        '40. Read `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/malph-reviewer-gpt/status.json`.\n' +
        '41. \n' +
        '42. | `result` | Action |\n' +
        '43. |---|---|\n' +
        '44. | `approved` | Record verdict, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '45. | `needs-revision` | Record verdict, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '46. | `failed` / `blocked` | Note error, continue to next reviewer |\n' +
        '47. \n' +
        '48. Update `state.md` — record the GPT verdict in the Reviewer Verdicts table.\n' +
        '49. \n' +
        '50. ### Step 3: Dispatch malph-reviewer-gemini\n' +
        '51. \n' +
        '52. Delegate to `malph-reviewer-gemini`. Wait for completion.\n' +
        '53. \n' +
        '54. Read `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/malph-reviewer-gemini/status.json`.\n' +
        '55. \n' +
        '56. | `result` | Action |\n' +
        '57. |---|---|\n' +
        '58. | `approved` | Record verdict, proceed to Phase 4 |\n' +
        '59. | `needs-revision` | Record verdict, proceed to Phase 4 |\n' +
        '60. | `failed` / `blocked` | Note error, proceed to Phase 4 |\n' +
        '61. \n' +
        '62. Update `state.md` — record the Gemini verdict in the Reviewer Verdicts table.\n' +
        '63. \n' +
        '64. ### Important\n' +
        '65. \n' +
        "66. - **Do NOT read any reviewer's `output.md` or `jira-findings.json`** during this phase — you are a router\n" +
        '67. - **Do NOT relay findings between reviewers** — they work independently\n' +
        '68. - Each reviewer runs the **same checklist** with independent judgment\n' +
        '69. - A reviewer failing does NOT block the remaining reviewers\n' +
        '70. '
