        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. # Phase 6: Archive & Exit\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. ## Before you begin\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. 1. **Read `state.md`** at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/state.md`\n' +
        '11. 2. **Verify the current phase** — this skill is for Phase 6.\n' +
        '12. 3. **Review completed phases** — confirm Phase 5 (Handoff) is done.\n' +
        '13. \n' +
        '14. ## Instructions\n' +
        '15. \n' +
        '16. ### 1. Dispatch the scribe\n' +
        '17. \n' +
        '18. Delegate to the `ralph-scribe` sub-agent. It will:\n' +
        '19. - Read all subagent artifacts from `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/`\n' +
        '20. - Post general observations and a task report to Ralphchives\n' +
        '21. - Write its status to `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/ralph-scribe/status.json`\n' +
        '22. \n' +
        '23. ### 2. Read scribe status\n' +
        '24. \n' +
        '25. Read `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/ralph-scribe/status.json`.\n' +
        '26. \n' +
        '27. | `result` | Action |\n' +
        '28. |---|---|\n' +
        '29. | `archived` | Proceed to exit |\n' +
        '30. | `skipped` | Proceed to exit (nothing worth archiving) |\n' +
        '31. | Any failure | Log it, proceed to exit anyway — archival is non-blocking |\n' +
        '32. \n' +
        '33. ### 3. Print exit block\n' +
        '34. \n' +
        '35. Output the result block — this is **mandatory** for orchestrator detection:\n' +
        '36. \n' +
        '37. ```\n' +
        '38. ===RALPH_RESULT_START===\n' +
        '39. STATUS: completed\n' +
        '40. SUMMARY: Review panel for {{ taskId }}. Verdict: APPROVED | NEEDS REVISION (N total findings across 3 reviewers).\n' +
        '41. ===RALPH_RESULT_END===\n' +
        '42. ```\n' +
        '43. \n' +
        '44. Use `completed` for both approvals and revision requests — Malph always completes successfully.'
    },
