        '23. # Review State: {{ taskId }} — {{ taskTitle }}\n' +
        '24. \n' +
        '25. ## Current Phase\n' +
        '26. Phase 1: Setup\n' +
        '27. \n' +
        '28. ### Skills for this phase\n' +
        '29. - malph-vscode-workflow-setup\n' +
        '30. \n' +
        '31. > ⚠️ STOP — Read every skill listed above BEFORE doing any work in this phase.\n' +
        '32. \n' +
        '33. ## Completed Phases\n' +
        '34. (none yet)\n' +
        '35. \n' +
        '36. ## Tracked Identifiers\n' +
        '37. - Branch: <branch from handoff>\n' +
