        '44. ## Reviewer Verdicts\n' +
        '45. | Reviewer | Verdict | Findings |\n' +
        '46. |---|---|---|\n' +
        '47. | malph-reviewer-opus | pending | — |\n' +
        '48. | malph-reviewer-gpt | pending | — |\n' +
        '49. | malph-reviewer-gemini | pending | — |\n' +
        '50. \n' +
        '51. ## Panel Verdict\n' +
        '52. (will be aggregated after all reviewers complete)\n' +
