      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '# Ralph Orchestrator - Fractal Factory Infrastructure Inventory\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## 1. FRACTAL FACTORY AGENTS (.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/)\n' +
        '\n' +
        '28 agent files totaling 3,881 lines. These are the exemplar patterns that produced systems should learn from.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### Core Orchestration\n' +
        '- **fractal-factory.agent.md** (136 lines)\n' +
        '  - Session orchestrator for the 7-pass pipeline\n' +
        '  - Routes between coordinators, handles re-entry from gap hunting\n' +
        '  - Pure router pattern — reads progress.json and status.json files\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### Pass 1: Discovery (4 agents)\n' +
        'Coordinators by discovery specialists to understand the domain:\n' +
        '\n' +
        '1. **fractal-factory-discovery-coordinator.agent.md** (83 lines)\n' +
        '   - Coordinates Pass 1 discovery\n' +
        '   - Dispatches 4 specialists sequentially: domain-scanner, invariant-extractor, asset-auditor, exemplar-analyzer\n' +
        '   - Pure router pattern\n' +
        '\n' +
        '2. **fractal-factory-domain-scanner.agent.md** (150 lines)\n' +
        '   - Reads domain-brief.md and domain-docs/\n' +
        '   - Produces initial domain model with subdomains\n' +
        '   - Writes to domain-model.json\n' +
        '\n' +
        '3. **fractal-factory-invariant-extractor.agent.md** (142 lines)\n' +
        '   - Extracts behavioral, structural, quality, and workflow invariants\n' +
        '   - Reads from invariants.md and domain materials\n' +
        '   - Adds extracted rules to domain-model.json with confidence scores\n' +
        '\n' +
        '4. **fractal-factory-asset-auditor.agent.md** (131 lines)\n' +
        '   - Scans workspace for reusable assets (skills, templates, MCP servers, agent includes)\n' +
        '   - Audits for relevance to produced system subdomains\n' +
        '   - Marks reusability level: direct, adaptable, reference-only\n' +
        '\n' +
        '5. **fractal-factory-exemplar-analyzer.agent.md** (153 lines)\n' +
        '   - Analyzes exemplar agent families (existing multi-agent systems in inputs.exemplars)\n' +
        '   - Extracts reusable patterns: hierarchy, naming conventions, routing idioms, artifacts\n' +
        '   - Categorizes patterns: hierarchy, naming, artifact, routing, anti-laziness, convergence\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### Pass 2: Analysis (3 agents)\n' +
        'Architecture design specialists:\n' +
        '\n' +
        '1. **fractal-factory-analysis-coordinator.agent.md** (78 lines)\n' +
        '   - Coordinates Pass 2 analysis\n' +
        '   - Dispatches 3 specialists: pipeline-architect, artifact-designer, depth-analyzer\n' +
        '   - Pure router pattern\n' +
        '\n' +
        '2. **fractal-factory-pipeline-architect.agent.md** (182 lines)\n' +
        '   - Designs the 7-pass pipeline for produced system\n' +
        '   - Decides which passes to enable, entry/exit conditions, re-entry rules\n' +
        '   - Writes architecture.json with pass definitions and cross-cutting concerns\n' +
        '\n' +
        '3. **fractal-factory-artifact-designer.agent.md** (167 lines)\n' +
        '   - Designs shared artifact schemas (JSON schemas, read-modify-write contracts)\n' +
        '   - Maps complete data flow between agents\n' +
        '   - Identifies universal artifacts (context.json, progress.json, manifest.json, status.json)\n' +
        '   - And domain-specific artifacts based on pipeline\n' +
        '\n' +
        '4. **fractal-factory-depth-analyzer.agent.md** (152 lines)\n' +
        '   - Analyzes domain complexity per coordinator\n' +
        '   - Decides depth-2 (coordinator→specialists) or depth-3 (coordinator→sub-coordinators→specialists)\n' +
        '   - Considers subdomain count, invariant complexity, exemplar patterns\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### Pass 3: Planning (3 agents)\n' +
        'Roster and routing design specialists:\n' +
        '\n' +
        '1. **fractal-factory-planning-coordinator.agent.md** (78 lines)\n' +
        '   - Coordinates Pass 3 planning\n' +
        '   - Dispatches 3 specialists: roster-planner, routing-planner, test-planner\n' +
        '   - Pure router pattern\n' +
        '\n' +
        '2. **fractal-factory-roster-planner.agent.md** (191 lines)\n' +
        '   - Plans complete agent roster: names, levels, parents, children, result codes\n' +
        '   - Assigns agents to subdomains and artifacts\n' +
        '   - Names coordinators per pass, specialists per subdomain\n' +
        '   - Writes roster.json with initial status\n' +
        '\n' +
        '3. **fractal-factory-routing-planner.agent.md** (158 lines)\n' +
