        '   - Writes audit-report.json with findings\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### Pass 6: Gap Hunting (1 agent + coordinator)\n' +
        '\n' +
        '1. **fractal-factory-gap-hunting-coordinator.agent.md** (73 lines)\n' +
