      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. ---\n' +
        '2. name: ralph-workflow\n' +
        `3. description: "Router for the Ralph documentation workflow — both standard (8 phases) and revision (7 phases). Read this skill at the start of every task and at every phase transition. It tells you which reference file to read for detailed phase instructions. Covers setup, research, write, review, commit, PR, and handoff phases. Always use this skill when working on any ralph documentation task — it's the single entry point for all workflow phases."\n` +
        '4. ---\n' +
        '5. \n' +
        '6. # Ralph Documentation Workflow\n' +
        '7. \n' +
        '8. This skill routes you to the correct phase instructions. Read the reference file for your current phase — each contains full instructions including the "Before moving to Phase N" checklist.\n' +
        '9. \n' +
        '10. **Your `state.md` file at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/state.md` is your phase-level source of truth.** Read it before every phase.\n' +
        '11. \n' +
        '12. When the planner loop is active, `ralph-planner/tasks.json` is the task-level control file:\n' +
        '13. - `state.md` tracks workflow phase, tracked identifiers, and human-readable notes\n' +
        '14. - `ralph-planner/tasks.json` tracks the active task, task lifecycle, and per-task attempt number\n' +
        '15. - the orchestrator still routes on subagent `status.json` results rather than on narrative `output.md` artifacts\n' +
        '16. \n' +
        '17. ---\n' +
        '18. \n' +
        '19. {%- if isRevision %}\n' +
        '20. \n' +
        '21. ## Revision Workflow\n' +
        '22. \n' +
        '23. **This is a revision of a previous attempt for {{ taskId }}.** A human reviewer has looked at your previous work, found issues, and transitioned the JIRA issue back for fixes.\n' +
        '24. \n' +
        '25. | Phase | Reference file | Summary |\n' +
        '26. |-------|---------------|---------|\n' +
        '27. | 1–2. Setup | `references/r1-setup.md` | Understand feedback, find existing branch & PR |\n' +
        '28. | 3. Fix | `references/r3-fix.md` | Dispatch ralph-planner, then ralph-writer for the active `in_progress` fix task from `tasks.json` |\n' +
        '29. | 4. Review | `references/4-review.md` | Review the current task, revise it if needed, then advance to the next task |\n' +
        '30. | 5. Commit | `references/r5-commit.md` | Commit, push, respond to PR threads |\n' +
        '31. | 6. Handoff & Exit | `references/r6-handoff.md` | Dispatch ralph-scribe, deliver revision handoff, print exit block |\n' +
        '32. \n' +
        '33. {%- else %}\n' +
        '34. \n' +
        '35. ## Standard Workflow\n' +
        '36. \n' +
        '37. | Phase | Reference file | Summary |\n' +
        '38. |-------|---------------|---------|\n' +
        '39. | 1. Setup | `references/1-setup.md` | Branch, scratchpad, ralphchives search |\n' +
        '40. {%- if triggerParams.codesamples and triggerParams.xpversion %}'
    },
