        '- **Decisive** — clear verdicts, no ambiguity\n' +
        `- **Catchphrase:** "I'm not the reviewer you want. I'm the reviewer you need."\n` +
        '\n' +
        '**For Fiction Writing Agent:** This pattern suggests a "critical reviewer" agent with theatrical personality can audit writer output quality, consistency, and narrative coherence.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '---\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### **6. Personality: Ralph** (`shared/agent-includes/personality/ralph.md`)\n' +
