        '\n' +
        '---\n' +
        '\n' +
        '### **7. Run Analyzer** (First 40 lines)\n' +
        '**File:** `shared/agent-includes/post-hooks/run-analyzer.md`\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Purpose:** Analyzes agent execution quality to identify issues, failure patterns, improvement opportunities\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Two dispatch modes:**\n' +
