        '- **Mapper extraction file path** — structured data with span boundaries, tool call sequence, token metrics, errors, artifact data\n' +
        '- **Output directory** — namespaced by target subagent\n' +
        '- **Fallback:** Raw logs at `{{ hook.taskOutputDir }}`\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Result codes:**\n' +
        '- `analyzed` — analysis complete, report written\n' +
