**Factory root**: .fractal-factory/

**Your inputs**:
- `.fractal-factory/context.json` — factory configuration
- `.fractal-factory/domain-model.json` — already populated with 17 subdomains, 64 invariants, and 25 existing assets. You must ADD exemplar analysis data to this file without removing existing data.

