        '170.   "iteration": 1\n' +
        '171. }\n' +
        '172. ```\n' +
        '173. \n' +
        '174. **Result codes**:\n' +
        '175. - `pass` — all agents and infrastructure pass validation\n' +
        '176. - `fail` — one or more critical failures found\n' +
        '177. \n' +
        '178. Write detailed narrative to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-checklist-validator/output.md` covering:\n' +
        '179. - Per-agent results table (agent, verdict, score, failure count)\n' +
        '180. - Complete list of failures with evidence\n' +
        '181. - Infrastructure validation results\n' +
        '182. - Score summary\n' +
        '183. \n' +
        '184. Prepend entry to `.fractal-factory/manifest.json` (newest first).\n' +
