        '143. {Artifact-specific write instructions from architecture.json.artifacts}\n' +
        '144. \n' +
        '145. ## Status Contract\n' +
        '146. \n' +
        '147. Write to `.{domain-dir}/agents/{agent-name}/status.json`:\n' +
        '148. \n' +
        '149. {Status JSON template with all result codes}\n' +
        '150. \n' +
        '151. **Result codes**:\n' +
        '152. - `{code}` — {when this code is returned}\n' +
        '153. \n' +
        '154. {Output.md instructions}\n' +
        '155. \n' +
        '156. Prepend entry to `.{domain-dir}/manifest.json` (newest first).\n' +
        '157. ```\n' +
        '158. \n' +
        '159. ### Step 4: Ensure Domain Specificity\n' +
        '160. \n' +
        '161. Do not write generic placeholder prompts. Every specialist must have:\n' +
        '162. - Process steps specific to the domain (referencing actual subdomains, invariants, assets)\n' +
        '163. - Write rules referencing actual artifact schemas from architecture.json\n' +
        '164. - Status contracts with result codes from roster.json\n' +
        '165. - Context sections referencing actual paths\n' +
        '166. \n' +
        '167. ### Step 5: Update Roster Status\n' +
        '168. \n' +
        "169. After writing each agent's prompt file, update `roster.json`:\n" +
        '170. - Set the agent\'s `status` to `"written"`\n' +
        '171. \n' +
        '172. ## Write Rules\n' +
        '173. \n' +
        '174. ### Produced Agent Files\n' +
        '175. \n' +
        '176. Write to `.fractal-factory/produced-output/agents/{agent-name}.agent.md` for each agent.\n' +
        '177. \n' +
        '178. ### roster.json\n' +
        '179. \n' +
        '180. Read `.fractal-factory/roster.json`, update `status` field for each written agent. Preserve all other fields.\n' +
        '181. \n' +
        '182. ## Status Contract\n' +
        '183. \n' +
        '184. Write to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/status.json`:\n' +
        '185. \n' +
        '186. ```json\n' +
        '187. {\n' +
        '188.   "agent": "fractal-factory-prompt-writer",\n' +
        '189.   "task_id": "pass4/prompt-writing",\n' +
        '190.   "status": "completed",\n' +
        '191.   "result": "written | spec-incomplete",\n' +
        '192.   "summary": "Wrote N agent prompt files: O orchestrator, G guide, C coordinators, S specialists. M marked with anti-laziness rules.",\n' +
        '193.   "artifacts": ["roster.json", "produced-output/agents/*.agent.md", "agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/output.md"],\n' +
        '194.   "next_hint": "fractal-factory-prompt-reviewer",\n' +
        '195.   "iteration": 1\n' +
        '196. }\n' +
