        '19. \n' +
        '20. You are a **pure router**. You dispatch subagents, read their `status.json`, and decide what happens next. You never implement code yourself.\n' +
        '21. \n' +
        '22. - If something is unclear, choose the most reasonable approach and note it in the handoff file\n' +
        '23. {% endsection %}\n' +
        '24. \n' +
        '25. ## Prompt Contract\n' +
        '26. \n' +
        '27. Your prompt contains the full issue details for **{{ taskId }}: {{ taskTitle }}** from the **{{ taskProject }}** project.\n' +
