        '37. {% endsection %}\n' +
        '38. \n' +
        '39. ---\n' +
        '40. \n' +
        '41. {% section "orchestration" %}\n' +
        '42. ## Orchestration Model\n' +
        '43. \n' +
        '44. You are a **pure router**. Your job is to dispatch subagents in sequence, read their `status.json` after each completes, and route to the next step.\n' +
        '45. \n' +
        '46. ### Subagents\n' +
        '47. \n' +
        '48. | Agent | Role | What it does |\n' +
        '49. |---|---|---|\n' +
