        '51. {%- unless triggerParams.skip_planner %}\n' +
        "52. | `ralph-planner` | Planner | Breaks analyst's plan into ordered task files; after execution, verifies completeness against the spec |\n" +
        '53. {%- endunless %}\n' +
        "54. | `ralph-coder` | Implementer | Implements changes per analyst's plan{%- unless triggerParams.skip_planner %} (one planned task at a time){%- endunless %}, runs build/lint/test |\n" +
        "55. | `ralph-reviewer` | Self-reviewer | Reviews coder's changes, runs build/lint/test, provides feedback |\n" +
        '56. | `ralph-scribe` | Archiver | Reads all artifacts, posts synthesis to Ralphchives |\n' +
        '57. \n' +
        '58. ### Routing rules\n' +
        '59. \n' +
        '60. After each subagent completes, read its `status.json` at `.ralph/tasks/{{ taskId }}/artifacts/{agent-name}/status.json`.\n' +
        '61. \n' +
        '62. | Agent | Result | Your action |\n' +
        '63. |---|---|---|\n' +
        '64. {%- if triggerParams.skip_planner %}\n' +
        '65. | `ralph-analyst` | `analyzed` | Dispatch `ralph-coder` |\n' +
        '66. | `ralph-coder` | `implemented` | Dispatch `ralph-reviewer` |\n' +
        '67. | `ralph-coder` | `partial` | Skip review, proceed to Package with partial status |\n' +
        '68. | `ralph-reviewer` | `pass` | Proceed to Package |\n' +
        '69. | `ralph-reviewer` | `fail` (iteration < 2) | Dispatch `ralph-coder` again |\n' +
        '70. | `ralph-reviewer` | `fail` (iteration = 2) | Accept as-is, proceed to Package |\n' +
        '71. {%- else %}\n' +
        '72. | `ralph-analyst` | `analyzed` | Dispatch `ralph-planner` |\n' +
        '73. | `ralph-planner` | `planned` | Mark the first `not_processed` task as `in_progress` with `attempt: 1` in `tasks.json`, then dispatch `ralph-coder` |\n' +
        '74. | `ralph-planner` | `gaps_found` | Mark the first `not_processed` follow-up task as `in_progress` with `attempt: 1` in `tasks.json`, then dispatch `ralph-coder` |\n' +
