        '47. | ASSET-005 | personality-malph | Replace code reviewer persona with literary critic/beta reader personas. Keep the adversarial thoroughness pattern. Multiple adaptations needed for different review lenses. |\n' +
        '48. | ASSET-006 | ralph-workflow-phased-pipeline | Replace 8 documentation phases with fiction phases (concept→worldbuild→character→plot→draft→revise→beta→polish). Keep state.md tracking and phase transition routing. |\n' +
        '49. | ASSET-007 | malph-review-panel-workflow | Replace technical/style/IA reviewers with romance/fantasy/craft/continuity reviewers. Keep the mechanical verdict aggregation from status.json. |\n' +
        '50. | ASSET-008 | malph-verdict-aggregation | Adapt verdict delivery for fiction context — aggregate beta reader feedback into prioritized revision directives instead of PR comments. |'
