    attributes: {
      'gen_ai.operation.name': 'execute_tool',
      'gen_ai.tool.name': 'view',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.id': 'toolu_01CP1RJtCi1x1hbnKa5bB424',
      'gen_ai.tool.type': 'function',
      'gen_ai.provider.name': 'github',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': '{"path":"/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractals/fractal-factory/schemas/progress.schema.md"}',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '1. # progress.json Schema\n' +
        '2. \n' +
        '3. Tracks pipeline state across the 7-pass fractal factory execution. Owned exclusively by the session orchestrator — no other agent writes to this file.\n' +
        '4. \n' +
        '5. ## Schema\n' +
        '6. \n' +
        '7. ```json\n' +
        '8. {\n' +
        '9.   "version": 1,\n' +
        '10.   "lastUpdated": "<ISO-8601-UTC timestamp | null>",\n' +
        '11.   "currentPass": "<0-7, 0 = not started>",\n' +
        '12. \n' +
        '13.   "passes": {\n' +
        '14.     "pass1_discovery": {\n' +
        '15.       "status": "pending | active | completed | re-entered",\n' +
        '16.       "completedAgents": "<number>",\n' +
        '17.       "totalAgents": "<number>",\n' +
        '18.       "coordinator": "<coordinator agent name>"\n' +
        '19.     },\n' +
        '20.     "pass2_analysis": { "...same shape..." },\n' +
        '21.     "pass3_planning": { "...same shape..." },\n' +
        '22.     "pass4_execution": { "...same shape..." },\n' +
        '23.     "pass5_verification": { "...same shape..." },\n' +
        '24.     "pass6_gapHunting": { "...same shape..." },\n' +
        '25.     "pass7_delivery": { "...same shape..." }\n' +
        '26.   },\n' +
        '27. \n' +
        '28.   "counts": {\n' +
        '29.     "subdomainsDiscovered": "<number>",\n' +
        '30.     "invariantsExtracted": "<number>",\n' +
        '31.     "agentsPlanned": "<number>",\n' +
        '32.     "agentsWritten": "<number>",\n' +
        '33.     "agentsVerified": "<number>",\n' +
        '34.     "agentsBlocked": "<number>"\n' +
        '35.   },\n' +
        '36. \n' +
        '37.   "gapHunting": {\n' +
        '38.     "cyclesCompleted": "<number>",\n' +
        '39.     "maxCycles": "<number, from context.json options>",\n' +
        '40.     "newItemsPerCycle": ["<number per cycle, e.g. [5, 2, 0]>"],\n' +
        '41.     "converged": "<boolean, true when last entry in newItemsPerCycle is 0>"\n' +
        '42.   }\n' +
        '43. }\n' +
        '44. ```\n' +
        '45. \n' +
        '46. ## Pass Status Transitions\n' +
        '47. \n' +
        '48. ```\n' +
        '49. pending → active → completed\n' +
        '50.                  → re-entered (from gap-hunting re-entry) → active → completed\n' +
        '51. ```\n' +
        '52. \n' +
        '53. On re-entry, the orchestrator:\n' +
        '54. 1. Sets the target pass status to `re-entered`\n' +
        '55. 2. Resets all passes AFTER the target pass to `pending`\n' +
        '56. 3. Increments `gapHunting.cyclesCompleted`\n' +
        '57. 4. On the next dispatch cycle, the re-entered pass transitions to `active`\n' +
        '58. \n' +
        '59. ## Recomputation Rules\n' +
        '60. \n' +
        '61. After each coordinator returns, the orchestrator recomputes counts by reading actual artifacts:\n' +
        '62. - `subdomainsDiscovered`: count entries in `domain-model.json.subdomains`\n' +
        '63. - `invariantsExtracted`: count entries in `domain-model.json.invariants`\n' +
        '64. - `agentsPlanned`: count entries in `roster.json.agents`\n' +
        '65. - `agentsWritten`: count agents in roster with status `written` or later\n' +
        '66. - `agentsVerified`: count agents in roster with status `verified`\n' +
        '67. - `agentsBlocked`: count agents in roster with status `blocked`\n' +
        '68. \n' +
        '69. ## Version History\n' +
        '70. \n' +
        '71. - Version 1: Initial schema\n' +
        '72. '
    },
