      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': '{"agent_type":"explore","description":"Analyze fractal-factory orchestrator","prompt":"Analyze the fractal factory orchestrator and its hierarchy patterns. Read and summarize:\\n\\n1. `.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory.agent.md` — the top-level orchestrator. Extract:\\n   - How the routing table is structured (what format, what fields)\\n   - What result codes are used\\n   - How passes/phases are organized\\n   - How re-entry and convergence are handled\\n   - The full agent dispatch sequence\\n\\n2. `.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-discovery-coordinator.agent.md` — a coordinator. Extract:\\n   - How it dispatches specialists\\n   - What result codes it returns\\n   - How it reads/writes status files\\n   - The status.json contract format\\n\\n3. `.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-execution-coordinator.agent.md` — another coordinator. Extract:\\n   - How it handles the writer→reviewer loop\\n   - How retries work\\n   - How convergence is detected\\n\\n4. `.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-gap-hunting-coordinator.agent.md` — the gap hunting coordinator. Extract:\\n   - How re-entry works\\n   - How cycle limits are enforced\\n   - How convergence is detected\\n\\nGive me the FULL routing tables, result code lists, and dispatch sequences from each file. I need the exact patterns."}',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': 'Perfect! I have all four files. Let me now provide you with a comprehensive summary with the exact patterns, tables, and formats.\n' +
