        '| `agents/fractal-factory-gap-hunting-coordinator/status.json` | `result: "gaps-found"` AND `gapHunting.currentCycle >= maxCycles` | Set gapHunting to `"completed"` (forced), advance to delivery |\n' +
        '| `progress.json` | `passes.delivery.status == "pending"` | Set to `"active"`, dispatch `fractal-factory-delivery-coordinator` |\n' +
