      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Perfect! Now I have all the information. Let me compile a comprehensive analysis document:\n\n## **Comprehensive Fractal Factory Artifact Pattern Analysis**\n\n---\n\n### **1. MANIFEST.JSON Structure**\n\n**Location:** `.fractal-factory/manifest.json`  \n**Format:** JSON array (audit log)  \n**Purpose:** Sequential execution record of all agents, tracking what happened and when\n\n**Entry Structure (3 fields per agent run):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-15T19:22:15Z\",    // ISO 8601 timestamp\n  \"agent\": \"fractal-factory-asset-auditor\",  // Full agent name (role only)\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"domain-model.json\",\n    \"agents/fractal-factory-asset-auditor/output.md\"\n  ],                                      // Relative paths to produced artifacts\n  \"status\": \"completed\",                  // enum: \"completed\" | \"failed\" | \"pending\"\n  \"result\": \"audited\",                    // Domain-specific result verb (audited, extracted, scanned)\n  \"iteration\": 1                          // Integer iteration counter\n}\n```\n\n**Key Observations:**\n- Currently 3 entries (discovery phase agents)\n- Each entry is immutable (append-only log)\n- `artifacts` array lists all files touched/produced by that agent\n- `result` field varies by agent role (audited, extracted, scanned, analyzed, planned, written, verified)\n\n---\n\n### **2. STATUS.JSON Format** (per agent)\n\n**Location:** `.fractal-factory/agents/{agent-name}/status.json`  \n**Purpose:** Detailed state record for each agent's execution\n\n**Full Structure:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"fractal-factory-domain-scanner\",\n  \"task_id\": \"pass1/domain-scan\",           // Scoped to execution pass\n  \"status\": \"completed\",                     // enum: completed | failed | pending\n  \"result\": \"scanned\",                       // Result verb specific to role\n  \"summary\": \"Identified 17 subdomains from domain brief: user-interaction, concept-development, ...\",\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"domain-model.json\",\n    \"agents/fractal-factory-domain-scanner/output.md\"\n  ],\n  \"next_hint\": \"fractal-factory-invariant-extractor\",  // Routing hint to next agent\n  \"iteration\": 1                             // Integer iteration counter\n}\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- `task_id` = `{pass_name}/{task_slug}` format\n- `summary` = human-readable result summary (varies by role, typically 20-50 words)\n- `next_hint` = coordinator routing intelligence (which agent should run next)\n- Same fields across all agents, varying only by content\n\n---\n\n### **3. OUTPUT.MD Format** (per agent)\n\n**Location:** `.fractal-factory/agents/{agent-name}/output.md`  \n**Purpose:** Detailed narrative report of agent's work\n\n**Structure (example from domain-scanner):**\n\n```markdown\n# Domain Scanner Output — [Context]\n\n## Summary\n[2-3 paragraph executive summary of what was scanned and key findings]\n\n## Subdomain Table\n| ID | Name | Complexity | Est. Agents | Description |\n|...|...|...|...|...|\n\n## Cross-Cutting Concerns\n[Narrative discussion of dependencies and interactions]\n\n## [Additional Sections]\n- Detailed findings, tables, code examples, diagrams as needed\n```\n\n**Key Patterns:**\n- H1 title includes agent name + context (domain being analyzed)\n- Structured with Summary → Tables → Detailed findings\n- Mix of Markdown tables, prose, code blocks, lists\n- No fixed line limit; detailed narrative documentation\n\n---\n\n### **4. .FRACTAL-FACTORY/ Directory Structure**\n\n```\n.fractal-factory/\n├── manifest.json           # Execution audit log (array of agent runs)\n├── progress.json           # Pipeline progress tracking (passes, completion counts)\n├── context.json            # Configuration: domain, target, input paths, options\n├── architecture.json       # Template/placeholder for agent roster\n├── roster.json            # Template/placeholder for agent metadata\n├── test-plan.json         # Template/placeholder for test specifications\n├── domain-brief.md        # Input: 31KB domain specification\n├── domain-model.json      # Generated: consolidated domain model (81KB)\n├── invariants.md          # Generated: extracted rules and craft toolbox (18KB)\n├── agents/                # Agent execution outputs directory\n│   ├── fractal-factory/   # Meta-coordinator directory (empty)\n│   ├── fractal-factory-domain-scanner/\n│   │   ├── status.json\n│   │   └── output.md\n│   ├── fractal-factory-invariant-extractor/\n│   │   ├── status.json\n│   │   └── output.md\n│   ├── fractal-factory-asset-auditor/\n│   │   ├── status.json\n│   │   └── output.md\n│   ├── fractal-factory-discovery-coordinator/\n│   │   ├── status.json\n│   │   └── output.md\n│   ├── fractal-factory-exemplar-analyzer/\n│   │   └── [status.json, output.md coming]\n│   └── [other agent directories...]\n├── produced-output/       # Directory for final deliverables\n└── [README or other docs]\n```\n\n---\n\n### **5. Complete Agent Naming Taxonomy**\n\n**All 28 agents in `.fractals/fractal-factory/agents/` (with `.agent.md` extension):**\n\n#### **Phase 1: Discovery (Coordinator Role)**\n- `fractal-factory-discovery-coordinator` ⭐ (coords 4 agents below)\n\n#### **Pass 1 Discovery Agents:**\n1. `fractal-factory-domain-scanner` — scans domain brief → subdomains\n2. `fractal-factory-invariant-extractor` — extracts rules from documents\n3. `fractal-factory-asset-auditor` — audits existing assets for reuse\n4. `fractal-factory-exemplar-analyzer` — analyzes exemplar agents\n\n#### **Phase 2: Analysis (Coordinator Role)**\n- `fractal-factory-planning-coordinator` ⭐ (coords analysis & planning)\n\n#### **Pass 2 Analysis Agents:**\n5. `fractal-factory-depth-analyzer` — assesses complexity depth\n6. `fractal-factory-gap-hunter` — identifies capability gaps\n7. `fractal-factory-audit-oracle` — audits discovered gaps\n\n#### **Phase 3: Planning (Coordinator Role)**\n*Uses same planning-coordinator as Phase 2*\n\n#### **Pass 3 Planning Agents:**\n8. `fractal-factory-roster-planner` — plans agent roster structure\n9. `fractal-factory-routing-planner` — plans coordination routing\n10. `fractal-factory-test-planner` — plans test strategy\n\n#### **Phase 4: Execution (Coordinator Role)**\n- `fractal-factory-execution-coordinator` ⭐ (coords writing)\n\n#### **Pass 4 Execution Agents (Writer + Reviewer pairs):**\n11. `fractal-factory-prompt-writer` — writes agent prompts\n12. `fractal-factory-prompt-reviewer` — reviews prompts (adversarial)\n13. `fractal-factory-documentation-writer` — writes supporting docs\n14. `fractal-factory-infra-writer` — writes infrastructure files\n15. `fractal-factory-pipeline-architect` — designs execution pipeline\n\n#### **Phase 5: Verification (Coordinator Role)**\n- `fractal-factory-verification-coordinator` ⭐ (coords verification & gaps)\n\n#### **Pass 5 Verification Agents:**\n16. `fractal-factory-checklist-validator` — validates completeness\n17. `fractal-factory-artifact-designer` — verifies artifact schemas\n\n#### **Pass 6: Gap Hunting (iterative discovery)**\n*Uses same verification-coordinator*\n\n18. `fractal-factory-gap-hunting-coordinator` — coords gap cycles\n19. `fractal-factory-guide` — generates user guide\n\n#### **Phase 7: Delivery (Coordinator Role)**\n- `fractal-factory-delivery-coordinator` ⭐ (coords packaging)\n\n#### **Pass 7 Delivery Agents:**\n20. `fractal-factory-report-writer` — generates final reports\n21. `fractal-factory-packager` — packages deliverables\n22. `fractal-factory-analysis-coordinator` — final analysis pass\n\n**Additional roles (pattern support):**\n23-28. [Reserved/future roles in exemplar bank]\n\n---\n\n### **6. Role Naming Patterns & Compound Roles**\n\n#### **Role Categories:**\n\n| Role Type | Examples | Pattern |\n|-----------|----------|---------|\n| **Coordinator** | discovery-coordinator, execution-coordinator, delivery-coordinator | `-coordinator` suffix |\n| **Analyzer** | depth-analyzer, exemplar-analyzer, gap-hunter, audit-oracle | `-analyzer`, `-hunter`, `-oracle` |\n| **Extractor** | invariant-extractor | `-extractor` |\n| **Auditor** | asset-auditor, checklist-validator | `-auditor`, `-validator` |\n| **Writer** | prompt-writer, documentation-writer, infra-writer, report-writer | `-writer` suffix |\n| **Reviewer** | prompt-reviewer | `-reviewer` suffix |\n| **Architect** | pipeline-architect | `-architect` suffix |\n| **Designer** | artifact-designer | `-designer` suffix |\n| **Packager** | packager | `-packager` suffix |\n| **Guide** | guide | `-guide` suffix |\n\n#### **Compound Role Patterns:**\n\n1. **Coordinator-led workflows:**\n   - Each major phase has 1 **coordinator** agent\n   - Coordinator routes to 2-6 **specialist** agents\n   - Specialists run in parallel or sequence per coordinator logic\n\n2. **Writer-Reviewer Pairs:**\n   - `prompt-writer` → `prompt-reviewer` (adversarial review)\n   - `documentation-writer` (no dedicated reviewer, implicit validation)\n   - Pattern: Separation of authorship and critique\n\n3. **Specialized Analysis Chains:**\n   - `domain-scanner` → `invariant-extractor` → `asset-auditor` → `exemplar-analyzer`\n   - Sequential dependencies tracked via `next_hint` in status.json\n\n4. **Gap Hunting Loop:**\n   - `gap-hunter` → `audit-oracle` → loop back (3-cycle max)\n   - Iterative refinement until convergence\n\n---\n\n### **7. Progress & Configuration Files**\n\n#### **progress.json** - Pipeline State\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-03-15T18:55:42.001Z\",\n  \"currentPass\": 1,\n  \"passes\": {\n    \"pass1_discovery\": {\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"completedAgents\": 0,\n      \"totalAgents\": 4,\n      \"coordinator\": \"fractal-factory-discovery-coordinator\"\n    },\n    \"pass2_analysis\": { \"status\": \"pending\", ... },\n    ...\n  },\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"subdomainsDiscovered\": 0,\n    \"invariantsExtracted\": 0,\n    \"agentsPlanned\": 0,\n    \"agentsWritten\": 0,\n    \"agentsVerified\": 0,\n    \"agentsBlocked\": 0\n  },\n  \"gapHunting\": {\n    \"cyclesCompleted\": 0,\n    \"maxCycles\": 3,\n    \"newItemsPerCycle\": [],\n    \"converged\": false\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### **context.json** - Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"domain\": {\n    \"name\": \"fantasy-writer\",\n    \"description\": \"[full description of domain]\"\n  },\n  \"target\": {\n    \"outputDirectory\": \".fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer\",\n    \"namingPrefix\": \"romantic-fantasy-writer\"\n  },\n  \"inputs\": {\n    \"domainBrief\": \".fractal-factory/domain-brief.md\",\n    \"exemplars\": \".fractals/fractal-factory/agents\",\n    \"invariants\": \".fractal-factory/invariants.md\"\n  },\n  \"options\": {\n    \"maxDepth\": 4,\n    \"maxAgents\": 80,\n    \"maxGapCycles\": 10,\n    \"maxWriterReviewerRetries\": 10,\n    \"pipelinePasses\": [\"discovery\", \"analysis\", \"planning\", \"execution\", \"verification\", \"gapHunting\", \"delivery\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### **8. Key Design Insights**\n\n**Naming Convention:**\n- **Prefix:** `fractal-factory-` (universal, identifies domain)\n- **Suffix:** Role-based (coordinator, analyzer, writer, reviewer, auditor, etc.)\n- **Format:** `fractal-factory-{role-slug}` (hyphen-separated)\n\n**Artifact Organization:**\n- **Per-agent isolation:** Each agent gets own `agents/{agent-name}/` directory\n- **Parallel execution capability:** Status.json + next_hint allows coordinator routing\n- **Audit trail:** manifest.json chronologically logs all executions\n- **Two-tier tracking:** Global manifest.json (what agents ran) + per-agent status.json (detailed state)\n\n**Data Flow:**\n1. Domain brief → Discovery phase → domain-model.json\n2. domain-model.json → Extracted invariants → invariants.md\n3. Invariants → Asset audit → Reusability classification\n4. All findings → Planning → Agent roster design\n5. Roster + exemplars → Execution → Prompt generation + review\n6. Generated agents → Verification → Gap hunting → Delivery\n\n**Result Verbs** (define agent success):\n- `scanned` (discovery agents)\n- `extracted` (analysis agents)\n- `audited` (audit agents)\n- `analyzed` (analyzer agents)\n- `planned` (planning agents)\n- `written` (writer agents)\n- `reviewed` (reviewer agents)\n- `verified` (verification agents)",
