        '    "agentsWritten": 0,\n' +
        '    "agentsVerified": 0\n' +
        '  },\n' +
        '  "gapHunting": {\n' +
        '    "cyclesCompleted": 0,\n' +
        '    "maxCycles": 3,\n' +
        '    "converged": false\n' +
        '  }\n' +
        '}\n' +
        '```\n' +
        '\n' +
        '#### **7-Pass Pipeline with Re-Entry**\n' +
        '\n' +
        '```\n' +
        'Pass 1: Discovery → discovery-coordinator\n' +
        'Pass 2: Analysis → analysis-coordinator\n' +
        'Pass 3: Planning → planning-coordinator\n' +
        'Pass 4: Execution → execution-coordinator (prompts + review loop)\n' +
        'Pass 5: Verification → verification-coordinator (checklist + oracle)\n' +
        'Pass 6: Gap Hunting → gap-hunting-coordinator\n' +
        '    ├─ if gaps-found AND cycles < maxCycles → re-enter Pass 2 or 3\n' +
        '    ├─ if converged → proceed to Pass 7\n' +
        '    └─ if cycles >= maxCycles → forced proceed to Pass 7\n' +
        'Pass 7: Delivery → delivery-coordinator (package + docs + report)\n' +
        '```\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Re-entry logic:**\n' +
        '1. Verification finds `gaps-found` → gap-hunter decides which pass to re-enter (2 or 3)\n' +
        '2. Increment `gapHunting.cyclesCompleted`\n' +
        '3. Reset all passes from re-entry point through pass 6 to `pending`\n' +
        '4. Resume pipeline from reset pass\n' +
        '5. Max 3 cycles; then forced proceed with gaps documented\n' +
        '\n' +
        '#### **Coordinator Purity Rule**\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Every coordinator is a **pure router**:\n' +
        '- Reads child `status.json` files\n' +
        '- Dispatches children in sequence\n' +
        '- Updates own `status.json`\n' +
        '- **NEVER** reads child `output.md` or writes domain artifacts\n' +
        '- **NEVER** does substantive work\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Example routing table** (discovery-coordinator):\n' +
        '```\n' +
        'Read domain-scanner status.json\n' +
        '  ├─ missing → Dispatch domain-scanner\n' +
        '  ├─ result: scanned → Dispatch invariant-extractor\n' +
        '  └─ result: insufficient-input → Write own status: blocked\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Read invariant-extractor status.json\n' +
        '  ├─ missing → Dispatch invariant-extractor\n' +
        '  ├─ result: extracted → Dispatch asset-auditor\n' +
        '  └─ ...\n' +
        '```\n' +
        '\n' +
        '#### **Specialist Execution Model**\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Specialists do substantive work:\n' +
        '- Read domain artifacts (`domain-model.json`, `context.json`, schemas)\n' +
        '- Perform analysis/generation\n' +
        '- Write to designated output files\n' +
        '- Write own `status.json` with result codes\n' +
        '- Prepend to `manifest.json`\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Example: prompt-writer**\n' +
        '- Reads: `roster.json`, `architecture.json`, `domain-model.json`, `test-plan.json`\n' +
        '- Writes: `.agent.md` files for each agent (bottom-up order: specialists → coordinators → orchestrator)\n' +
        '- Checks `status` field in roster; skips already-written agents\n' +
        '\n' +
        '#### **Produced Agent Prompt Schema**\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Every agent `.agent.md` follows strict universal structure:\n' +
        '\n' +
        '```markdown\n' +
        '---\n' +
        "description: '...'\n" +
        'model: claude-opus-4.6\n' +
        "name: 'prefix-agent-name'\n" +
        'user-invocable: false  # true only for guide\n' +
        '---\n' +
        '\n' +
        '# Agent Title\n' +
        '\n' +
        'You are a **{role}** for the {domain} system.\n' +
        '\n' +
        'You must never use `ask_questions` or request human input.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Context\n' +
        'Read `.<domain>/context.json` for...\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Inputs\n' +
        '1. Artifact A\n' +
        '2. Artifact B\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Process  # Specialists\n' +
        'OR\n' +
        '## Purity Rule  # Coordinators\n' +
        'OR\n' +
        '## Pipeline Routing  # Orchestrator\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Write Rules\n' +
        'Write to `.<domain>/agents/<name>/status.json` (schema)\n' +
        'Write to `.<domain>/agents/<name>/output.md`\n' +
        'Prepend to `.<domain>/manifest.json`\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Status Contract\n' +
        '{ result codes and schema }\n' +
        '```\n' +
        '\n' +
        '#### **Artifact Schemas**\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Fractal factory defines schemas for:\n' +
        '- `domain-model.schema.md` — domain structure (subdomains, invariants, dependencies)\n' +
        '- `context.schema.md` — execution config\n' +
        '- `progress.schema.md` — pipeline state\n' +
        '- `produced-agent.schema.md` — agent prompt structure\n' +
        '- And output artifacts: `roster.json`, `architecture.json`, `test-plan.json`, `manifest.json`'... 5035 more characters
