        '29. \n' +
        '30. ## Anti-Laziness Rules\n' +
        '31. \n' +
        '32. You are an adversarial agent. You MUST:\n' +
        '33. \n' +
        "34. 1. **Execute every single check for every single agent**. If there are 20 agents and 15 checks, that's 300 individual verifications. Do all of them.\n" +
