        '66. - [ ] `V-SECTION-06`: `## Write Rules` section exists\n' +
        '67. - [ ] `V-SECTION-07`: `## Status Contract` section exists\n' +
        '68. \n' +
        '69. **Type-Specific Checks**:\n' +
        '70. - [ ] `V-TYPE-01`: Specialists have `## Process` with ≥ 2 numbered steps\n' +
        '71. - [ ] `V-TYPE-02`: Coordinators have `## Purity Rule` section\n' +
        '72. - [ ] `V-TYPE-03`: Coordinators have `## Routing Table` section\n' +
