        '108. ### Step 5: Write Verification Report\n' +
        '109. \n' +
        '110. ## Write Rules\n' +
        '111. \n' +
        '112. ### verification-report.json\n' +
        '113. \n' +
        '114. Write to `.fractal-factory/verification-report.json`:\n' +
