        '104. - Subdomain IDs in invariant.affectedSubdomains exist in subdomains array\n' +
        '105. - Result codes in routing tables match roster.json result codes\n' +
        '106. \n' +
        '107. **Gap**: A dangling reference that points to nothing.\n' +
        '108. \n' +
        '109. ### Category 7: Bootstrap Completeness\n' +
        '110. \n' +
        '111. **Methodology**: Verify the produced bootstrap script:\n' +
        '112. - Creates a directory for every agent in roster.json\n' +
        '113. - Seeds every artifact from architecture.json\n' +
        '114. - Includes all required universal artifacts\n' +
        '115. \n' +
        '116. **Gap**: An agent directory or artifact not created by bootstrap.\n' +
        '117. \n' +
        '118. ### Category 8: Documentation Completeness\n' +
        '119. \n' +
        '120. **Methodology**: Check that the produced system includes:\n' +
        '121. - Schema documentation for every artifact\n' +
        '122. - At least one README or guide document\n' +
        '123. - Skill stubs for referenced skills\n' +
        '124. \n' +
        '125. **Gap**: Missing documentation that a user would need.\n' +
        '126. \n' +
        '127. ## Write Rules\n' +
        '128. \n' +
        '129. ### gap-report.json\n' +
        '130. \n' +
        '131. Write to `.fractal-factory/gap-report.json`:\n' +
        '132. \n' +
        '133. ```json\n' +
        '134. {\n' +
        '135.   "version": 1,\n' +
        '136.   "lastUpdated": "<ISO-8601-UTC>",\n' +
        '137.   "cycle": 1,\n' +
        '138.   "verdict": "clean | dirty",\n' +
        '139.   "categories": [\n' +
        '140.     {\n' +
        '141.       "id": 1,\n' +
        '142.       "name": "Subdomain Coverage",\n' +
        '143.       "methodology": "For each of N subdomains, checked: agent coverage, process references, test scenarios",\n' +
        '144.       "itemsChecked": 8,\n' +
        '145.       "gapsFound": 1,\n' +
        '146.       "gaps": [\n' +
        '147.         {\n' +
        '148.           "id": "GAP-001",\n' +
        '149.           "description": "Subdomain SD-005 (error-handling) has no dedicated specialist in the produced system",\n' +
        '150.           "severity": "critical | warning",\n' +
        '151.           "evidence": "SD-005 exists in domain-model.json but no agent in roster.json lists it in reads/writes",\n' +
        `152.           "suggestedFix": "Add an error-handling specialist or assign error-handling to an existing specialist's process steps",\n` +
        '153.           "reEntryTarget": "pass3 (roster needs update)"\n' +
        '154.         }\n' +
        '155.       ]\n' +
        '156.     }\n' +
        '157.   ],\n' +
        '158.   "summary": {\n' +
        '159.     "totalCategories": 8,\n' +
        '160.     "categoriesClean": 6,\n' +
        '161.     "categoriesDirty": 2,\n' +
        '162.     "totalGaps": 3,\n' +
        '163.     "criticalGaps": 1,\n' +
        '164.     "warningGaps": 2,\n' +
        '165.     "suggestedReEntryPass": "pass2 | pass3 | null"\n' +
        '166.   }\n' +
        '167. }\n' +
        '168. ```\n' +
        '169. \n' +
        '170. **Verdict rules**:\n' +
        '171. - Any `critical` gap → `dirty`\n' +
        '172. - Only `warning` gaps → `dirty` (but lower priority re-entry)\n' +
        '173. - Zero gaps → `clean`\n' +
        '174. \n' +
        '175. ## Status Contract\n' +
        '176. \n' +
        '177. Write to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-gap-hunter/status.json`:\n' +
