3. **depth-analyzer** — analyze domain complexity to decide depth-2 vs depth-3 hierarchy per coordinator

Write results to `.fractal-factory/architecture.json` and your status to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-analysis-coordinator/status.json`.

Remember: dispatch specialists sequentially, wait for each to complete. Do not use background mode.
