ine-architect/status.json` — completed/designed\n- `agents/fractal-factory-pipeline-architect/output.md` — full narrative report\n- `manifest.json` — entry prepended\n\n**Next agent**: `fractal-factory-artifact-designer` (designs shared artifact schemas for the produced system)",
