      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': 'PATTERN-001:\n' +
        '  Three-tier hierarchy: guide → orchestrator → pass-coordinators → specialists. Each pipeline pass has exactly one coordinator that owns dispatch sequencing for 2-6 specialists. Coordinators never do substantive work (pure routing). Guide is the sole user-facing entry point, separate from the orchestrator.\n' +
