        'PATTERN-003:\n' +
        "  Routing tables use three-column format: Read (which status.json) | Condition (result code check) | Action (dispatch agent or write own status). Missing status.json means agent hasn't run yet → dispatch it. Each result code maps to exactly one action. This creates a deterministic, re-entrant state machine.\n" +
