      'gen_ai.tool.type': 'function',
      'gen_ai.provider.name': 'github',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': `{"command":"cd /home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator && python3 << 'PYEOF'\\nimport json\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\\n\\n# Load existing architecture.json\\nwith open('.fractal-factory/architecture.json') as f:\\n    arch = json.load(f)\\n\\n# Design the complete artifacts section\\nartifacts = {\\n    \\"designRationale\\": \\"The romantic-fantasy-writer system produces deeply subcategorized creative artifacts organized per-book with series-level accumulators. The artifact design follows 5 principles: (1) subcategory decomposition — artifacts with 3+ distinct topics split into separate files per INV-031/INV-055/INV-064, (2) per-chapter isolation — each chapter is a separate file enabling sequential production per INV-012, (3) cross-cutting accumulators — continuity tracker and series KB span multiple phases with read-modify-write discipline, (4) phase-gated data flow — each phase's outputs feed the next phase's inputs with no backward dependencies except the bounded beta→revision re-entry, (5) schema-first contracts — every shared artifact has a defined JSON schema so agents can load/modify/write without ambiguity.\\",\\n\\n    \\"universal\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\"name\\": \\"story-config.json\\",\\n            \\"purpose\\": \\"All user inputs and story parameters: premise, constraints, series position, optional reference fiction paths, optional style samples. Single source of truth for what the user requested (INV-048, INV-050).\\",\\n            \\"schema\\": {\\n                \\"fields\\": [\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"storyId\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"Unique story identifier (e.g., 'book-1', 'series-enchanted-bonds-book-2')\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"premise\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"The story idea — minimum viable input (INV-050)\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"seriesPosition\\", \\"type\\": \\"object\\", \\"description\\": \\"{ seriesName, bookNumber, isSequel, priorBooksPath }\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"constraints\\", \\"type\\": \\"object\\", \\"description\\": \\"{ chapterCount, targetWordCount, pov, subgenre, heatLevel, contentBoundaries }\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"referenceInputs\\", \\"type\\": \\"object\\", \\"description\\": \\"{ styleSamples: string[], referenceFiction: string[] } — optional paths\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"craftOverrides\\", \\"type\\": \\"array\\", \\"description\\": \\"Optional user-specified craft tools to include/exclude from T1-T14\\"}\\n                ]\\n            },\\n            \\"writers\\": [\\"romantic-fantasy-writer-guide\\"],\\n            \\"readers\\": [\\"all agents\\"],\\n            \\"writeProtocol\\": \\"create-once\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\"name\\": \\"progress.json\\",\\n            \\"purpose\\": \\"Pipeline state tracking for the 9-phase creative pipeline. Records which phase is active, which are complete, cycle counts for re-entry loops.\\",\\n            \\"schema\\": {\\n                \\"fields\\": [\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"currentPhase\\", \\"type\\": \\"number\\", \\"description\\": \\"Active phase number (1-9)\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"phases\\", \\"type\\": \\"object\\", \\"description\\": \\"Map of phase-name → { status: pending|active|completed|blocked, startedAt, completedAt, iterations }\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"betaRevisionCycles\\", \\"type\\": \\"number\\", \\"description\\": \\"Count of beta→revision re-entry cycles (bounded by maxCycles)\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"overallStatus\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"pending | in-progress | completed | failed\\"}\\n                ]\\n            },\\n            \\"writers\\": [\\"romantic-fantasy-writer-orchestrator\\"],\\n            \\"readers\\": [\\"romantic-fantasy-writer-orchestrator\\", \\"all coordinators\\", \\"romantic-fantasy-writer-guide\\"],\\n            \\"writeProtocol\\": \\"read-modify-write\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\"name\\": \\"manifest.json\\",\\n            \\"purpose\\": \\"Immutable audit trail of all agent executions, prepend-only (newest first). Records every action taken during story production.\\",\\n            \\"schema\\": {\\n                \\"fields\\": [\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"timestamp\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"ISO-8601 UTC timestamp\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"agent\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"Agent name that performed the action\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"phase\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"Creative pipeline phase (concept, world-building, etc.)\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"artifacts\\", \\"type\\": \\"array\\", \\"description\\": \\"List of artifact paths written or modified\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"status\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"completed | failed\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"result\\", \\"type\\": \\"string\\", \\"description\\": \\"Domain-specific result verb\\"},\\n                    {\\"name\\": \\"iteration\\", \\"type\\": \\"number\\", \\"description\\": \\"Iteration counter for writer-reviewer loops\\"}\\n                ]\\n            },\\n            \\"writers\\": [\\"all agents\\"],\\n            \\"readers\\": [\\"romantic-fantasy-writer-polish-delivery-coordinator\\", \\"romantic-fantasy-writer-guide\\"],\\n            \\"writeProtocol\\": \\"prepend-only\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\"name\\": \\"agents/*/status.json\\",\\n            \\"purpose\\": \\"Per-agent routing signal following the universal 8-field contract (PATTERN-006). Read by parent coordinators for routing decisions.\\",\\n            \\"schema\\": {\\n                \\"fields\\": [\\n                    {\\"name\