      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': '{"path":"/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-artifact-designer/output.md","file_text":"# Artifact Designer Output — romantic-fantasy-writer\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nDesigned **34 shared artifacts** (4 universal + 30 domain-specific) for the romantic-fantasy-writer agent family. The artifact layer covers all 9 creative pipeline phases plus 2 cross-cutting accumulator systems, with 5 multi-writer contracts and 23 data-flow edges verified acyclic.\\n\\n## Artifact Inventory\\n\\n### Universal Artifacts (4)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Readers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| U1 | `story-config.json` | User inputs, premise, constraints, series position (INV-048, INV-050) | guide | all agents | create-once |\\n| U2 | `progress.json` | Pipeline state: current phase, completion status, cycle counts | orchestrator | orchestrator, coordinators, guide | read-modify-write |\\n| U3 | `manifest.json` | Immutable audit trail, prepend-only (newest first) | all agents | polish-delivery-coordinator, guide | prepend-only |\\n| U4 | `agents/*/status.json` | Per-agent 8-field routing signal (PATTERN-006) | each agent (own) | parent coordinator | create-once-per-iteration |\\n\\n### Phase 1: Concept Development (2 artifacts)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D1 | `story-concept.json` | Crystallized concept: genre promise, dual-arc, world seed, tone, scope (INV-001, INV-030) | concept-writer | create-once |\\n| D2 | `story-craft-profile.json` | Selected craft tools T1-T14 (5-8 per story), two-tier quality system (INV-032, INV-063) | concept-writer | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 2: World Building (6 artifacts — subcategorized per INV-031, INV-055)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D3 | `world-bible/geography.json` | Locations, terrain, climate, travel routes (LOC-NNN) | world-writer | create-once |\\n| D4 | `world-bible/magic-system.json` | Rules, costs, limitations, abilities, Sanderson\'s Law (MAG-NNN) (INV-009) | world-writer | create-once |\\n| D5 | `world-bible/politics.json` | Factions, governance, conflicts, treaties (FAC-NNN) | world-writer | create-once |\\n| D6 | `world-bible/culture.json` | Customs, religions, naming conventions, social hierarchy (CUL-NNN) (INV-058) | world-writer | create-once |\\n| D7 | `world-bible/history.json` | Timeline, eras, founding myths, historical figures (HIST-NNN) | world-writer | create-once |\\n| D8 | `world-bible/flora-fauna.json` | Creatures, plants, ecosystems (CREAT-NNN, PLANT-NNN) | world-writer | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 3: Character Design (2 artifact patterns)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D9 | `characters/cast-index.json` | Master character index, relationships, naming registry, voice matrix (CHAR-NNN) (INV-003, INV-058) | character-writer | create-once |\\n| D10 | `characters/{character-slug}.json` | Individual character profile: backstory, psychology, arc, voice guide, knowledge boundary (INV-003, INV-008, INV-022) | character-writer | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 4: Plot Architecture (4 artifacts)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D11 | `plot/structure-framework.json` | Story structure + dual-arc overlay, act breaks, black moment (FBEAT/RBEAT-NNN) (INV-021, T7, T12) | plot-writer | create-once |\\n| D12 | `plot/chapter-outlines.json` | Per-chapter outline: POV, scenes, beats, Chekhov items (CH-NNN, SCN-NNN) (INV-010) | plot-writer | create-once |\\n| D13 | `plot/tension-map.json` | Tension rise-fall per chapter, pacing validation, stakes escalation (INV-020, T6, T13) | plot-writer | create-once |\\n| D14 | `plot/subplot-tracker.json` | All subplots with status, characters, resolution tracking (SUB-NNN) | plot-writer | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 5: Prose Style Development (1 artifact)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D15 | `style-guide.json` | Voice, tone, vocabulary, sentence rhythm, POV variations, reference analysis (INV-005, INV-017, INV-018, INV-019, INV-024) | style-analyst | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 6: Chapter Drafting (2 artifact patterns)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D16 | `chapters/chapter-{NNN}.md` | Individual chapter prose, one file per chapter (INV-012) | chapter-drafter → revision agents → polish-agent | create-once-then-revise |\\n| D17 | `chapters/chapter-{NNN}-metadata.json` | Chapter metadata: scenes, word count, craft compliance, revision status | chapter-drafter + all editors | **read-modify-write** (multi-writer) |\\n\\n### Cross-Cutting: Continuity Tracking (1 artifact)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D18 | `continuity-tracker.json` | Running continuity state: timeline, positions, knowledge matrix, Chekhov registry, established facts (INV-011, INV-016) | continuity-tracker | **read-modify-write** (accumulator) |\\n\\n### Cross-Cutting: Series Knowledge Base (1 artifact)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D19 | `series-knowledge-base.json` | Series-level canon, character evolution, world evolution, naming registry, retcon log (INV-049, INV-051, INV-056, INV-058) | series-kb-manager | **read-modify-write** (accumulator) |\\n\\n### Phase 7: Revision (3 artifacts)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D20 | `revision/developmental-findings.json` | Plot holes, pacing, character consistency, structural issues (DEV-NNN) (INV-014) | developmental-editor | create-once |\\n| D21 | `revision/line-edit-findings.json` | Prose quality, voice, show-dont-tell, dialogue, clichés (LINE-NNN) (INV-003, INV-005, INV-017) | line-editor | create-once |\\n| D22 | `revision/copy-edit-findings.json` | Grammar, spelling, formatting, proper nouns, factual consistency (COPY-NNN) | copy-editor | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 8: Beta Reading (6 artifacts — 5 parallel lenses + synthesis)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D23 | `beta-reading/romance-lens.json` | Romance reader: chemistry, emotional resonance, HFN/HEA (BR-NNN) (INV-053) | romance-beta-reader | create-once |\\n| D24 | `beta-reading/fantasy-lens.json` | Fantasy reader: world immersion, magic coherence, plot engagement (BF-NNN) (INV-053) | fantasy-beta-reader | create-once |\\n| D25 | `beta-reading/craft-lens.json` | Craft reader: prose quality, structure, craft tool compliance (BC-NNN) (INV-053) | craft-beta-reader | create-once |\\n| D26 | `beta-reading/sensitivity-lens.json` | Sensitivity reader: representation, consent, power dynamics (BS-NNN) (INV-053) | sensitivity-beta-reader | create-once |\\n| D27 | `beta-reading/originality-lens.json` | Originality checker: plagiarism, derivative passages, cliché structures (BO-NNN) (INV-023, INV-024, INV-025) | originality-beta-reader | create-once |\\n| D28 | `beta-reading/synthesis.json` | Aggregated findings, cross-lens conflicts, go/no-go verdict (BETA-NNN) (INV-054) | beta-synthesis-agent | create-once |\\n\\n### Phase 9: Polish & Delivery (2 artifacts)\\n\\n| # | Artifact | Purpose | Writers | Protocol |\\n|---|----------|---------|---------|----------|\\n| D29 | `delivery/chapter-summaries.json` | One-paragraph summary per chapter for series KB and reference | polish-agent | create-once |\\n| D30 | `delivery/book-metadata.json` | Final book metadata: title, blurb, word count, quality scores, production metrics | polish-agent | create-once |\\n\\n## Data Flow Diagram\\n\\n```\\n                    ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n                    │                  SERIES KB (sequel)                  │\\n                    │           series-knowledge-base.json                 │\\n                    └──────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘\\n                                       │ (loaded for sequels)\\n                                       ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│ PHASE 1: CONCEPT                                                            │\\n│   story-concept.json ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\\n│   story-craft-profile.json ────────────────────────────────────────┐   │    │\\n└──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──┼───┘    │\\n               │                                                  │  │        │\\n               ▼                                                  │  │        │\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐               │  │        │\\n│ PHASE 2: WORLD BUILDING                         │               │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/geography.json                    │               │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/magic-system.json                 │               │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/politics.json        ─────────────┼───────────┐   │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/culture.json                      │           │   │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/history.json                      │           │   │  │        │\\n│   world-bible/flora-fauna.json                  │           │   │  │        │\\n└──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘           │   │  │        │\\n               │                                              │   │  │        │\\n               ▼                                              │   │  │        │\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐           │   │ 