rsarial-quality-gates\\", \\"series-knowledge-management\\"],\\n63.       \\"discoveredBy\\": \\"fractal-factory-domain-scanner\\"\\n64.     },\\n65.     {\\n66.       \\"id\\": \\"SD-007\\",\\n67.       \\"name\\": \\"chapter-drafting\\",\\n68.       \\"description\\": \\"Phase 6: the core prose production engine. Writes each chapter sequentially following the outline, maintaining consistent character voice per POV, scene structure (goal/conflict/disaster), prose style adherence, worldbuilding consistency, romance arc pacing, and chapter hooks (opening hooks + closing cliffhangers). Chapters MUST be produced in order (N+1 only after N is complete with continuity recorded). Updates a running continuity document after each chapter.\\",\\n69.       \\"sourceFiles\\": [\\".fractal-factory/domain-brief.md\\", \\".fractal-factory/invariants.md\\"],\\n70.       \\"complexity\\": \\"high\\",\\n71.       \\"estimatedAgentCount\\": 4,\\n72.       \\"crossCuttingConcerns\\": [\\"continuity-tracking\\", \\"genre-compliance\\", \\"adversarial-quality-gates\\", \\"craft-toolbox-framework\\"],\\n73.       \\"discoveredBy\\": \\"fractal-factory-domain-scanner\\"\\n74.     },\\n75.     {\\n76.       \\"id\\": \\"SD-008\\",\\n77.       \\"name\\": \\"revision-editing\\",\\n78.       \\"description\\": \\"Phase 7: exhaustive multi-pass self-editing. Developmental edit (plot holes, pacing, character motivation gaps, romance arc satisfaction, worldbuilding contradictions, theme reinforcement, structural problems). Line edit (prose quality, dialogue naturalism, overwriting/underwriting, repetitive usage, show vs. tell, cliché detection, POV consistency). Copy edit (grammar, naming consistency, timeline accuracy, factual accuracy within world rules). Every revision must cite what finding prompted it for full traceability.\\",\\n79.       \\"sourceFiles\\": [\\".fractal-factory/domain-brief.md\\", \\".fractal-factory/invariants.md\\"],\\n80.       \\"complexity\\": \\"high\\",\\n81.      