uts (Write Rules):**\\n- `.fractal-factory/produced-output/agents/{agent-name}.agent.md` for each agent\\n- Update `roster.json` setting `status` to `\\"written\\"`\\n\\n**Status Contract:**\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"agent\\": \\"fractal-factory-prompt-writer\\",\\n  \\"task_id\\": \\"pass4/prompt-writing\\",\\n  \\"status\\": \\"completed\\",\\n  \\"result\\": \\"written | spec-incomplete\\",\\n  \\"summary\\": \\"Wrote N agent prompt files: O orchestrator, G guide, C coordinators, S specialists. M marked with anti-laziness rules.\\",\\n  \\"artifacts\\": [\\"roster.json\\", \\"produced-output/agents/*.agent.md\\", \\"agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/output.md\\"],\\n  \\"next_hint\\": \\"fractal-factory-prompt-reviewer\\",\\n  \\"iteration\\": 1\\n}\\n```\\n**Result Codes:** `written`, `spec-incomplete`\\n\\n**Anti-Laziness Rules:** None in this agent\\n\\n**Shared Directory I/O:**\\n- Reads: `.fractal-factory/context.json`, `roster.json`, `architecture.json`, `domain-model.json`, `test-plan.json`\\n- Writes: `.fractal-factory/produced-output/agents/{agent-name}.agent.md`, updates `roster.json`\\n\\n**Manifest Pattern:**\\n- Prepend entry (same structure as Domain Scanner)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### **3. FRACTAL-FACTORY-PROMPT-REVIEWER** (Reviewer/Verification Specialist)\\n\\n**Main Sections:**\\n```\\n# Prompt Reviewer\\n  ## Context\\n  ## Inputs\\n  ## Anti-Laziness Rules\\n  ## Process\\n    ### Step 1: Enumerate Files to Review\\n    ### Step 2: Structural Review (Per Agent)\\n      {Frontmatter subsection}\\n      {Required Sections subsection}\\n      {Type-Specific Sections subsection}\\n      {Universal Sections subsection}\\n    ### Step 3: Content Review (Per Agent)\\n      {Domain specificity subsection}\\n      {Routing completeness subsection}\\n      {Result code consistency subsection}\\n    ### Step 4: Write Review Results\\n    ### Step 5: Update Roster Status\\n  ## Write Rules\\n    ### roster.json\\n  ## Status Contract\\n```\\n\\n**Inputs:**\\n1. Numb