ors.\\"\\n6.   },\\n7.   \\"target\\": {\\n8.     \\"outputDirectory\\": \\".fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer\\",\\n9.     \\"namingPrefix\\": \\"romantic-fantasy-writer\\"\\n10.   },\\n11.   \\"inputs\\": {\\n12.     \\"domainBrief\\": \\".fractal-factory/domain-brief.md\\",\\n13.     \\"domainDocs\\": null,\\n14.     \\"exemplars\\": \\".fractals/fractal-factory/agents\\",\\n15.     \\"invariants\\": \\".fractal-factory/invariants.md\\",\\n16.     \\"constraints\\": null\\n17.   },\\n18.   \\"options\\": {\\n19.     \\"maxDepth\\": 4,\\n20.     \\"maxAgents\\": 80,\\n21.     \\"maxGapCycles\\": 10,\\n22.     \\"maxWriterReviewerRetries\\": 10,\\n23.     \\"pipelinePasses\\": [\\"discovery\\", \\"analysis\\", \\"planning\\", \\"execution\\", \\"verification\\", \\"gapHunting\\", \\"delivery\\"]\\n24.   }\\n25. }\\n26. "}]},{"role":"tool","parts":[{"type":"tool_call_response","id":"toolu_018LbExhe1kKzAxoiMNeuMqy","response":"=== TOP LEVEL KEYS ===\\n['version', 'lastUpdated', 'pipeline', 'artifacts', 'depth']\\n\\n=== PIPELINE PASSES ===\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"discovery\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 4\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"analysis\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 3\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"planning\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 3\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"execution\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 3\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"verification\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 2\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"gapHunting\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 1\\n}\\n\\n{\\n  \\"name\\": \\"delivery\\",\\n  \\"estimatedAgents\\": 3\\n}\\n\\n=== DEPTH DECISIONS ===\\n{\\n  \\"designRationale\\": \\"The romantic-fantasy-writer system uses a uniform depth-2 hierarchy for all phase coordinators. Despite 17 subdomains and 64 invariants, the creative pipeline naturally decomposes into 9 phases where each phase coordinator manages 2-6 specialists \\\\u2014 all well under the 8-specialist threshold for depth-3 escalation. Cross-cutting concerns (adversarial quality gates, continuity tracking, genre compliance, craft toolbox, originality assurance, series knowledge management, artifact management) are enforcement responsibilities embedded into specialist agent prompts rather than separate routing layers. The highest specialist count is beta-reading (6: five parallel lenses + synthesizer), which is still within depth-2 capacity. The overall system depth is 3 levels (guide \\\\u2192 orchestrator \\\\u2192 coordinator \\\\u2192 specialist), well within the maxDepth=4 limit, leaving room for future depth-3 escalation if any phase grows during roster planning.\\",\\n  \\"maxAllowedDepth\\": 4,\\n  \\"systemDepthLevels\\": {\\n    \\"level0\\": \\"guide (user-facing entry point)\\",\\n    \\"level1\\": \\"orchestrator (9-phase sequential pipeline dispatcher)\\",\\n    \\"level2\\": \\"phase coordinators (one per creative phase, pure routers)\\",\\n    \\"level3\\": \\"specialists (writers, auditors, editors, lenses, trackers)\\"\\n  },\\n  \\"actualSystemDepth\\": 3,\\n  \\"depthThresholds\\": {\\n    \\"specialistCountThreshold\\": 8,\\n    \\"crossCuttingConcernsThreshold\\": 3,\\n    \\"subdomainGroupsThreshold\\": 3,\\n    \\"description\\": \\"If ANY criterion exceeds its threshold AND maxDepth allows it, coordinator escalates to depth-3 with sub-coordinators grouping specialists by subdomain cluster.\\"\\n  },\\n  \\"decisions\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\"coordinator\\": \\"romantic-fantasy-writer-orchestrator\\",\\n      \\"role\\": \\"top-level-orchestrator\\",\\n      \\"depth\\": 2,\\n      \\"estimatedDirectChildren\\": 10,\\n      \\"estimatedSpecialists\\": 0,\\n      \\"crossCuttingConcerns\\": 7,\\n      \\"subdomainGroups\\": 9,\\n      \\"criteria\\": {\\n        \\"specialistCount\\": {\\n          \\"value\\": 10,\\n          \\"threshold\\": 8,\\n          \\"exceeds\\": true\\n        },\\n        \\"crossCuttingConcerns\\": {\\n          \\"value\\": 7,\\n          \\"threshold\\": 3,\\n          \\"exceeds\\