ors.\\"\\n6.   },\\n7.   \\"target\\": {\\n8.     \\"outputDirectory\\": \\".fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer\\",\\n9.     \\"namingPrefix\\": \\"romantic-fantasy-writer\\"\\n10.   },\\n11.   \\"inputs\\": {\\n12.     \\"domainBrief\\": \\".fractal-factory/domain-brief.md\\",\\n13.     \\"domainDocs\\": null,\\n14.     \\"exemplars\\": \\".fractals/fractal-factory/agents\\",\\n15.     \\"invariants\\": \\".fractal-factory/invariants.md\\",\\n16.     \\"constraints\\": null\\n17.   },\\n18.   \\"options\\": {\\n19.     \\"maxDepth\\": 4,\\n20.     \\"maxAgents\\": 80,\\n21.     \\"maxGapCycles\\": 10,\\n22.     \\"maxWriterReviewerRetries\\": 10,\\n23.     \\"pipelinePasses\\": [\\"discovery\\", \\"analysis\\", \\"planning\\", \\"execution\\", \\"verification\\", \\"gapHunting\\", \\"delivery\\"]\\n24.   }\\n25. }\\n26. "}]},{"role":"tool","parts":[{"type":"tool_call_response","id":"toolu_01QUfHgQePQPY7nwati8hQAJ","response":"Top-level keys: ['version', 'lastUpdated', 'pipeline', 'artifacts', 'depth']\\n\\nPipeline keys: ['designRationale', 'producedSystemOverview', 'passes', 'reEntryRules', 'convergence']\\n\\nPasses:\\n  Pass ?: discovery -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Always first — context.json and domain-brief.md exist\\n    exit: All 4 discovery agents have status 'completed': domain-scanner (scanned), invariant-extractor (extracted), asset-auditor (audited), exemplar-analyzer (analyzed). domain-model.json contains all sections populated.\\n  Pass ?: analysis -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 1 (discovery) completed — domain-model.json fully populated with 17 subdomains, 64 invariants, 25 assets, 20 exemplar patterns\\n    exit: All 3 analysis agents have status 'completed': pipeline-architect (designed), artifact-designer (designed), depth-analyzer (analyzed). architecture.json contains pipeline, artifacts, and depth sections all populated.\\n  Pass ?: planning -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 2 (analysis) completed — architecture.json fully populated with pipeline, artifacts, and depth sections\\n    exit: All 3 planning agents have status 'completed': roster-planner (planned), routing-planner (planned), test-planner (planned). roster.json populated with all agents. Routing tables defined for every coordinator. test-plan.json populated.\\n  Pass ?: execution -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 3 (planning) completed — roster.json populated with all agents, routing tables defined, test-plan.json populated\\n    exit: All execution agents have status 'completed': prompt-writer (written — all prompts), prompt-reviewer (approved — all prompts pass review or maxRetries reached), infra-writer (written). All .agent.md files exist in produced output directory.\\n  Pass ?: verification -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 4 (execution) completed — all .agent.md files written and reviewed, infra artifacts produced\\n    exit: Both verification agents have status 'completed': checklist-validator (verified), audit-oracle (audited). Verification report produced. If critical issues found, status includes findings for gap-hunting to process.\\n  Pass ?: gapHunting -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 5 (verification) completed — all prompts verified and audited\\n    exit: Gap hunter returns 'clean' (zero new items found) → converged. OR gap cycle count reaches maxGapCycles (10) → proceed to delivery with outstanding items flagged.\\n  Pass ?: delivery -> coordinator: ?\\n    entry: Pass 6 (gap hunting) converged OR maxGapCycles reached. All prompts, infra, and verification artifacts are final.\\n    exit: All 3 delivery agents have status 'completed': packager (packaged), documentation-writer (documented), report-writer (reported). Output directory contains the complete agent family ready for deployment.\\n\\nRe-entry rules:\\n  {\\"trigger\\": \\"Gap hunter finds invariants not enforced by any agent or cross-cutting concerns missing from phase prompts\\", \\"reEntryPass\\": 2, \\"resetPasses\\": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \\"maxReEntries\\": 2, \\"rationale\\": \\"Architecture-level gaps (missing artifact schemas, incorrect depth decisions, unmodeled cross-cutting concerns) require re-analysis before roster and prompt changes can be planned\\"}\\n  {\\"trigger\\": \\"Gap hunter finds missing agents in roster, incomplete routing tables, or unhandled result codes\\", \\"reEntryPass\\": 3, \\"resetPasses\\": [3, 4, 5, 6], \\"maxReEntries\\": 3, \\"rationale\\": \\"Roster or routing gaps require re-planning before prompts can be updated. Most common trigger: writer-reviewer loop handling for a phase missing the re-dispatch routing\\"}\\n  {\\"trigger\\": \\"Gap hunter finds prompt-level issues: missing invariant enforcement, incorrect artifact references, or shallow anti-laziness rules\\", \\"reEntryPass\\": 4, \\"resetPasses\\": [4, 5, 6], \\"maxReEntries\\": 5, \\"rationale\\": \\"Most gap-hunting findings will be prompt-level: a craft tool not mentioned in an auditor's checklist, a continuity-tracker update step missing from the chapter-drafter's process, or a beta reader lens not covering a required check. These are fixed by re-entering execution (prompt-writer updates \\\\u2192 prompt-reviewer re-reviews)\\"}\\n  {\\"trigger\\": \\"Verification finds critical structural violations (pure-router breach, status contract violation, missing manifest prepend)\\", \\"reEntryPass\\": 4, \\"resetPasses\\": [4, 5], \\"maxReEntries\\": 2, \\"rationale\\": \\"Structural violations in prompts require re-writing and re-verification but do not invalidate the roster or routing plan\\"}\\n<exited with exit code 0>"}]},{"role":"tool","parts":[{"type":"tool_call_response","id":"toolu_01EXVz8Dtn1TwnyhsKGMmNFR","response":"Top-level keys: ['version', 'lastUpdated', 'namingPrefix', 'agents']\\n\\n\\nTotal agents: 43\\n\\nTraceback (most recent call last):\\n  File \\"<string>\\", line 18, in <module>\\nAttributeError: 'list' object has no attribute 'items'\\n<exited with exit code 1>"}]},{"role":"tool","par