ed\\" on success.\\n\\nStatus format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"agent\\": \\"fractal-factory-routing-planner\\",\\n  \\"task_id\\": \\"pass3/routing\\",\\n  \\"status\\": \\"completed\\",\\n  \\"result\\": \\"planned\\",\\n  \\"summary\\": \\"Routing planned: N routing tables, M re-entry rules, K convergence bounds\\",\\n  \\"artifacts\\": [\\"roster.json\\", \\"agents/fractal-factory-routing-planner/status.json\\"],\\n  \\"next_hint\\": \\"test-planner\\",\\n  \\"iteration\\": 1\\n}\\n```"}',
